2.
Definitions
.-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Protection of Human Rights Act, 1993 (
10 of 1994
);
(b)
"Audit Officer" means the Comptroller and Auditor General of India or any person appointed by him in connection with
the audit of the accounts of the Commission;
(c)
"Commission" means the National Human Rights Commission constituted under section 3 of the Act;
(d)
"Form" means the form appended to these rules;
(e)
"Secretary General" means the Officer appointed by Central Government under section 11 of the Act.
